  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Zhao tribe joins Ma tribe army, Fei Cai greets Zhao Lian Yun as Lady Xiao Yun beside the camp pond. She befriends him for information, coaches him through a shoe-theft frame meant to remove her informant, and keeps him reporting back when the plan works.",
      "chapters": [
        520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_zhao_tribe",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "char_fei_cai",
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is about five or six. She looks carved out of jade, extremely cute in embroidered clothing, with soft dark hair and large gleaming black eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the camp pond she resembles jade, with pinkish skin and crystal clear eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is too short to pat Fei Cai’s shoulder unless he squats, and she has a tiny head.",
      "chapters": [
        522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is dressed in white, clothes moving with the wind, with long black silky hair and clear skin.",
      "chapters": [
        2091
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-dress",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Full biography under her personal name is on Zhao Lian Yun.",
